title: "ads-two-shell-chaos: code and data for \"Interacting shells in anti-de Sitter space revisited: an invariant measure, regular orbits, and chaos\""
authors:
  - family-names: Sako
    given-names: Yusaku
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
